<title>UK: Oresundskonsortiet sets 200 mln Dkr nine-year bond.</title>
<headline>Oresundskonsortiet sets 200 mln Dkr nine-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager Enskilda Debt Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ORESUNDSKONSORTIET</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DKR   COUPON     4.0 PCT   MATURITY   9-YEARS</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE   29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    UNDISC    LISTING    COPENHAGEN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    DANISH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
